msgstr ""
"Impressum: <a "
"href=\"https://reportedip.com/impressum/\">reportedip.com/impressum</a>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Service URL: <a href=\"https://reportedip.com\">reportedip.com</a>"
msgstr "Dienst-URL: <a href=\"https://reportedip.com\">reportedip.com</a>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Operator: Patrick Schlesinger, Germany"
msgstr "Betreiber: Patrick Schlesinger, Deutschland"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Data sent: only the access key under verification"
msgstr "Gesendete Daten: nur der zu prüfende Access Key"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Trigger: an administrator clicks \"Test connection\" in the plugin settings"
msgstr ""
"Auslöser: Ein Administrator klickt in den Plugin-Einstellungen auf "
"„Verbindung testen“"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Auth header: <code>X-Key: {entered-key}</code>"
msgstr "Auth-Header: <code>X-Key: {entered-key}</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/verify-key</code>"
msgstr ""
"URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/verify-key</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Data sent: the offending IP, an integer category ID for the threat type and "
"a short comment (e.g. \"5 failed logins in 15 minutes\")"
msgstr ""
"Gesendete Daten: die angreifende IP, eine numerische Kategorie-ID für die "
"Art der Bedrohung und ein kurzer Kommentar (z. B. „5 failed logins in 15 "
"minutes“)"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Trigger: a brute-force or spray threshold has been exceeded; the report is "
"queued in the database and sent by a 15-minute cron job"
msgstr ""
"Auslöser: Ein Schwellenwert für Brute-Force oder Password-Spraying wurde "
"überschritten; die Meldung wird in der Datenbank vorgemerkt und von einem "
"Cronjob alle 15 Minuten gesendet"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "HTTP verb: POST (JSON body)"
msgstr "HTTP-Methode: POST (JSON-Body)"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/report</code>"
msgstr "URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/report</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Data NOT sent: usernames, passwords, cookies, server identifiers, domain "
"name"
msgstr ""
"NICHT gesendete Daten: Benutzernamen, Passwörter, Cookies, Server-Kennungen,"
" Domainname"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Data sent: only the source IP address of the current login attempt"
msgstr ""
"Gesendete Daten: nur die Quell-IP-Adresse des aktuellen Anmeldeversuchs"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Timeout: 2 seconds (fail-open, the login proceeds when the API does not "
"respond)"
msgstr ""
"Timeout: 2 Sekunden (Fail-open, die Anmeldung läuft weiter, wenn die API "
"nicht antwortet)"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Trigger: a login attempt reaches <code>wp_authenticate_user</code>"
msgstr ""
"Auslöser: Ein Anmeldeversuch erreicht <code>wp_authenticate_user</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Auth header: <code>X-Key: {your-access-key}</code>"
msgstr "Auth-Header: <code>X-Key: {your-access-key}</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "HTTP verb: GET"
msgstr "HTTP-Methode: GET"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/check?ip={ip}</code>"
msgstr ""
"URL: <code>https://reportedip.com/wp-json/reportedip/v2/check?ip={ip}</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"Actions: <code>reportedip_hive_log</code>, "
"<code>reportedip_hive_ip_blocked</code>, "
"<code>reportedip_hive_report_queued</code>."
msgstr ""
"Actions: <code>reportedip_hive_log</code>, "
"<code>reportedip_hive_ip_blocked</code>, "
"<code>reportedip_hive_report_queued</code>."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<code>wp_login_failed</code> increments a per-IP counter with an atomic "
"upsert, so there are no race conditions under concurrent attacks."
msgstr ""
"<code>wp_login_failed</code> erhöht einen Zähler pro IP mit einem atomaren "
"Upsert, daher gibt es auch bei gleichzeitigen Angriffen keine Race "
"Conditions."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Community Network (optional).</strong> When you enter a free "
"Community Access Key from reportedip.com, the plugin also checks the source "
"IP against the reportedip.com community database during login attempts and "
"shares blocked IPs back to the community. Both calls are clearly disclosed "
"in the settings and in the \"External services\" section below."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Community Network (optional).</strong> Wenn du einen kostenlosen "
"Community Access Key von reportedip.com einträgst, prüft das Plugin bei "
"Anmeldeversuchen zusätzlich die Quell-IP gegen die Community-Datenbank von "
"reportedip.com und meldet gesperrte IPs an die Community zurück. Beide "
"Aufrufe werden in den Einstellungen und im Abschnitt „Externe Dienste“ "
"weiter unten klar offengelegt."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Local Shield (default).</strong> Counts failed logins per IP and "
"blocks attackers based on your thresholds. The plugin makes zero outbound "
"network requests in this mode, all data stays on your server."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Local Shield (Standard).</strong> Zählt fehlgeschlagene Anmeldungen "
"pro IP und sperrt Angreifer anhand deiner Schwellenwerte. In diesem Modus "
"stellt das Plugin keine einzige ausgehende Netzwerkanfrage, alle Daten "
"bleiben auf deinem Server."

